      "description": "Purdue Careers | West Lafayette IN | Facebook Facebook Log In Log In Forgot Account? Purdue Careers 4.3K followers • 143 following Posts About Reels Photos More Posts About Reels Photos Purdue Careers Intro Check out each tab to learn about career opportunities at Purdue. Page · College & university 401 S Grant St, West Lafayette, IN, United States, Indiana (765) 496-5627 careers@purdue.edu purdue.edu/careers?utm_id=97758_v0_s00_e0_tv0 Open now 96% recommend (13 reviews) ﻿ Photos See all photos Privacy · Consumer Health Privacy · Terms · Advertising · Ad Choices · Cookies · More Purdue Careers 1d · Shared with Public Top 10 again! … See more All reactions: 3 Like Comment See more from Purdue Careers | West Lafayette IN See more from Purdue Careers | West Lafayette IN Email or phone number Password Log In Forgot password? or Create new account"
