    "https://twitter.com/purduecareers?lang=en": {
      "title": "Purdue Careers",
      "description": "Purdue Careers (@PurdueCareers) / X Log in Sign up Purdue Careers 4,372 posts Purdue Careers @PurdueCareers Work with purpose. Grow with pride. Find Your Path at Purdue. West Lafayette, IN careers.purdue.edu Joined August 2012 715 Following 1,313 Followers Mention Follow Posts Posts Replies Replies Reposts Reposts Media Media Log in or sign up for X See what’s happening and join the conversation Continue with phone Continue with Apple Continue with Google or Log in with username or email Terms · Privacy · Cookies · Accessibility · US TIDA · Ads Info · More © 2026 X Corp. Purdue Careers @PurdueCareers Sep 8 Top 10 again! 🏆 Purdue has been named one of the nation's Top 10 public universities for career success. From first jobs to leadership roles, Boilermakers continue to thrive. Thanks to the faculty and staff who mentor, support, and champion student success every step of the way. 4 70 Purdue Careers @PurdueCareers Sep 7 This Labor Day, we're celebrating the thousands of Purdue employees whose work behind the scenes helps students, faculty, and researchers reach new heights every day.\n\nThank you for all you do. #WhyPurdue #PurdueCareers #LaborDay #WhyPurdue #Boilermakers #PurdueCareers 35 Purdue Careers @PurdueCareers Sep 4 By popular de-meow-nd... the HR Purr-due Pet Team returns! From expert treat negotiators to dedicated work-from-home supervisors, your pets proved they're an essential part of the team. Now, let's keep the fun going. Share a photo of your favorite furry coworker below! 📸🐶🐱 21 Purdue Careers @PurdueCareers Sep 3 T-Minus 1 Day Until Kickoff!⏰The lights are ready. The fans are ready. The Boilers are ready. 🏈Tomorrow we kick off the first home game of the season and start a new chapter of Purdue Football memories. Grab your black & gold and get ready to bring the energy. Boiler Up! 🚂💛🖤 30 Purdue Careers @PurdueCareers Sep 2 🎉 Happy Global Talent Acquisition Day!\n\nWhy Purdue? It's the people. Today we're celebrating the talent professionals who help exceptional individuals find their place here. Thank you for building teams, supporting careers, and shaping Purdue's future. 💛🖤 #WhyPurdue 1 3 157"
    },
